  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/10/IMG_5538.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(18 fotos) El centro The Learning Office, hasta ahora en la calle Salvador Barri, ha trasladado sus instalaciones a la calle Concepci&oacute;n, 53, junto al cuartel de la Guardia Civil de Onda. Todas las aulas tienen luz solar directa y unas excelentes vistas, donde seguir estudiando ingl&eacute;s, valenciano, castellano, matem&aacute;ticas, f&iacute;sica y qu&iacute;mica o t&eacute;cnicas de estudio.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficenoulocal/img_5536.jpg\" alt=\"img_5536\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficenoulocal/img_5538.jpg\" alt=\"img_5538\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficenoulocal/img_5540.jpg\" alt=\"img_5540\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficenoulocal/img_5543.jpg\" alt=\"img_5543\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficenoulocal/img_5545.jpg\" alt=\"img_5545\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficenoulocal/img_5547.jpg\" alt=\"img_5547\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficenoulocal/img_5549.jpg\" alt=\"img_5549\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/thelearningofficenoulocal/img_5554.jpg\" alt=\"img_5554\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439